pub const TERNARY_NOTE : str = "Q, K, V, O, up and down in each block and the output head are ternary: each has an f64 shadow, requantized after every update with TWN (delta = 0.7 mean |w|, alpha = mean |w| over the kept entries, one alpha per matrix; nn/ternary_ste quantize_twn). The embedding, RMSNorm gains and biases are trained directly in floats.";

